8	/**
9	 * Emits an audit trail line for a newly created owner. Runs after the owner has been
10	 * saved so the assigned id is available. The line is published to the dedicated
11	 * {@code AUDIT} logger and carries the owner id, the customerCode and the
12	 * registrationDate.
